# Compositor notes (Bob)

- one rAF loop for all animations (windows, dock, overview)
- windows are layers with `will-change: transform` only while moving; removed afterwards to free GPU memory
- z-order is an array; focus = move to end, then assign z-index by position
- hit testing uses the DOM; no custom picking
- overview: static snapshots via `drawImage` of each window's canvas where possible
- budget: 16.7 ms frame p95 with 10 windows
